<title>NORWAY: Hafslund 9-month pre-tax profits fall.</title>
<headline>Hafslund 9-month pre-tax profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Sales revenues		1,109	vs	949</p>
<p>Operating result		177	vs	205</p>
<p>Pre-tax result		  212	vs	274</p>
<p>After-tax result		163	vs	195</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name cof Norwegian power producer and distributor is Hafslund ASA. The company was demerged from pharmaceuticals group Nycomed ASA in May and listed separately on the Oslo bourse on May 14.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
